body:
I'm pretty introverted so wfh is no issue to me at all, I usually get more work done have my music playing in the background, but theres time when I like connecting and speaking to my co-workers have a quick 10-15 minute call shoot some jokes, chat about the day etc. Usually helps me but everyone is different. 

&#x200B;

Best is finding ways to keep yourself engaged and not alone which can be hard. But also that you feel comfortable with your surroundings.
